The key to piloting Celes, Rune Knight is understanding its core engine: Celes discards and draws on entry, and buffs your entire team with +1/+1 counters whenever creatures enter from or are cast from a graveyard, synergizing with reanimation spells and recursive creatures.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Smothering Tithe, Demonic Tutor, Jeska's Will. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Celes, Rune Knight :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Lurrus of the Dream-Den :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Sun Titan :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Karmic Guide :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Reanimate :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Animate Dead :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

# High-Impact Engines and Support
Faithless Looting :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Boros Charm :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Blasphemous Act :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Swords to Plowshares :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Anguished Unmaking :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion

# Game Changers and Interaction
Smothering Tithe :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Demonic Tutor :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Jeska's Will :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Arcane Signet :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Sol Ring :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
